---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/about-hero.png';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="The person behind sidequesting.dev — into tech, heading toward offensive security, building in public."
	pubDate={new Date('August 11 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm the one behind sidequesting — you can call me DrMrProfessor, or MinimumWageWizard.
	</p>

	<p>
		I've always been drawn to tech, but somewhere along the way it sharpened into something
		specific: cybersecurity, and a genuine conviction that privacy is worth fighting for. This
		site is where I document the journey from "into tech" to "does this for a living" — the
		projects, the dead ends, the things I break and then figure out.
	</p>

	<p>
		The direction I'm heading is offensive security — red teaming and the emerging world of AI
		security. It's a field that rewards curiosity, stubbornness, and a willingness to pull things
		apart to understand how they really work, which happens to be how I'm wired.
	</p>

	<p>
		Most of what you'll find here is me building in public. A homelab that's equal parts learning
		platform and rabbit hole. A budgeting app I'm writing because the market wouldn't build the
		one I wanted. Notes from the courses and certs I'm working through. Whatever side quest has my
		attention this week — hence the name.
	</p>

	<p>
		I keep this space pseudonymous on purpose. If I'm going to advocate for privacy, it'd be a bit
		rich not to practise it. You'll get my work, my thinking, and my voice — just not my PII.
	</p>

	<p>
		If any of that resonates, stick around. There's more coming.
	</p>
</Layout>
